REQUIREMENTS:
=============
- POC-first approach (start simple, validate, expand)
- Mobile-friendly (touch events)
- Cartoon UI for kids
- LocalStorage for persistence
- Three distinct modes for different age groups
- No game engines - pure Canvas 2D API

